The newly remastered September Sessions now in 4k is showing Friday night (9/19) at Solento Surf Festival. Directed by @JackJohnson and starring surf icons @KellySlater, @Rob_Machado, @ShaneDorian, @RossWilliamsHawaii, Brad Gerlach, and @LukeEgan, this 16mm classic chronicles a rare, golden moment in surf history — and as Taylor Steele put it, “this film captures such an authentic feel of a surf trip with friends. Yet it’s also the best surfers in the world in their prime. Add in amazing cinematography and the perfect soundtrack. Showing how much of a filmmaking auteur Jack truly is.”

@JackJohnson, @Rob_Machado, and Brad Gerlach @WaveKi will be in the house for a special post-screening panel 🎤🔥

